*** Settings ***

Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  tests for DSS feature 2574-A [2574-A1 : CellSetup and Cell Failure Case]
...                                actRateMatchedCsiIm is mandatoy to setup 5GC002574-A
...                                actLteNrDssFastAlloc is false by default and activated by test if needed
...                                actLteNrDssLteCatM is activated by default
